      "acceptable_refusal": false,
      "predicted_refusal": false,
      "answer_text": "The theme of the Stern Godzilla pinball machine centers around the iconic monster Godzilla and the world of kaiju (giant monsters) that he inhabits. The game includes elements like battles with other monsters and iconic Godzilla features, offering an immersive experience based on the beloved movie franchise. \n\nFor more details, you can refer to Stern\u0027s Godzilla documentation.",
