      ],
      "acceptable_refusal": false,
      "predicted_refusal": false,
      "answer_text": "The main objective in the Stern *Foo Fighters LE* pinball machine (2023) is to help the Foo Fighters save humanity from an alien invasion led by a villain known as the Overlord. Players embark on a story-driven journey to rescue humans imprisoned by aliens across various locations. This involves completing missions by hitting specific shots on the playfield and unlocking multiballs, special modes, and high-scoring features.\n\nFor more detailed insight into the gameplay, you can explore the Foo Fighters pinball tutorial [[cite:2]], or refer to the OPDB profile.",
