      "acceptable_refusal": false,
      "predicted_refusal": false,
      "answer_text": "The **Attack from Mars Remake** is a 2017 reissue of the classic pinball machine **Attack from Mars**, originally designed by Brian Eddy in 1995. \n\nThis remake was manufactured by **Chicago Gaming Company** in collaboration with **Planetary Pinball Supply**. It faithfully preserves the beloved gameplay of the original while incorporating modernized features such as an updated display, enhanced LED lighting, and improved sound. The remake has been offered in three editions: **Classic**, **Special**, and **Limited**, each with varying features.\n\nYou can find more details on its Open Pinball Database (OPDB) page.",
