        "Gr3EW-MD3Nj"
      ],
      "acceptable_refusal": false,
      "predicted_refusal": false,
      "answer_text": "To play Williams\u0027 **Monster Bash** (1998) and reach its highly-sought \u0022Monsters of Rock\u0022 wizard mode, you need to focus on its two main progression paths: collecting all six monsters and their associated instruments through various modes and multiballs.\n\n### Main Steps\n1. **Start Monster Modes**: Each monster (e.g., Dracula, Frankenstein, the Wolfman) has a specific playfield shot or mechanic to light their character. Modes are themed after restoring each monster\u2019s role in the band (e.g., Bride of Frankenstein on vocals or Creature from Black Lagoon on saxophone). Starting these will count towards unlocking Monster Bash.\n\nFor canon with equally facts-concept ***",
      "scores": {
        "citation_precision": 1,
        "citation_recall": 1,
        "citation_coverage": 0.3333333333333333,
        "subagent_accuracy": 1,
        "refusal_correctness": 1,
