    {
      "id": "ev-rules-kin-0002",
      "question": "What\u0027s the strategy for Stern\u0027s The Walking Dead pinball, and how do I get to the wizard mode?",
      "expected_sub_agent": "Rules",
      "predicted_sub_agent": "Rules",
      "expected_citation_set": [
        "G5nz5-M7Z94"
      ],
      "predicted_citation_set": [
        "G5nz5-M7Z94"
      ],
      "acceptable_refusal": false,
      "predicted_refusal": false,
      "answer_text": "Stern\u0027s *The Walking Dead* pinball (2015) offers deep and intense gameplay, with strategies focused on completing multiballs, modes, and progressing toward wizard modes. Below is a guide:\n\n---\n\n### Gameplay Strategy\n\n1. **Main Objectives**:\n   - The game revolves around completing episode modes themed after *The Walking Dead*. Each episode advances your progress toward wizard mode.\n\n2. **Multiballs**:\n   - **Prison Multiball**: Hit the prison to light locks and start multiball. Collect jackpots for high scoring.\n   - **Well Walker Multiball**: Bash the Well Walker, then hit lit shots to score jackpots and super jackpots.\n   - **Bloodbath Multiball**: Unlock this by completing all drop target banks (Weapons). It\u0027s highly valuable and can stack with other multiballs.\n\n3. **Arena Mode**: Activates by shooting ramps. Complete it to add progress toward wizard mode objectives.\n\n4. **Horde Mode**: Complete all drop targets to light Horde. It\u0027s a chaotic, high-stakes mode that sets up wizard mode progression.\n\n---\n\n### Reaching the Wizard Mode: *Last Man Standing*\n\n1. **Complete Episodes**:\n   - Play and complete all modes. These are required to unlock the wizard mode.\n\n2. **Progress Through Horde Mode**:\n   - Surviving or successfully completing it brings you closer to unlocking *Last Man Standing*.\n\n3. **Finish Major Objectives**:\n   - Complete Prison, Well Walker, and Bloodbath Multiballs.\n\n4. **Activate *Last Man Standing***:\n   - After completing all prerequisites, this final wizard mode becomes available.\n\n---\n\n### Tips for Success\n\n- **Stack Multiballs**: Combine Bloodbath with other multiballs for massive scoring while maintaining ball safety.\n- **Control the Playfield**: Precise shots and flipper control help sustain progress.\n- **Prioritize Episode Modes**: Since these are vital for wizard mode, progress consistently through them.\n\n---\n\nFor deeper insights, tutorials like this one are great resources. More details about the machine can be found in its OPDB entry. Good luck battling the walkers!",
      "scores": {
        "citation_precision": 1,
        "citation_recall": 1,
        "citation_coverage": 0.05555555555555555,
        "subagent_accuracy": 1,
        "refusal_correctness": 1,
        "answered_all_editions": null,
        "honest_substitution": null,
        "grounding_integrity": 1
      },
      "duration_ms": 36442.6023,
      "error": null
