    {
      "id": "ev-rules-kin-0003",
      "question": "How do I play Bally\u0027s Theatre of Magic? What are the main modes I should focus on?",
      "expected_sub_agent": "Rules",
      "predicted_sub_agent": "Rules",
      "expected_citation_set": [
        "G5BLE-MQ75Y"
      ],
      "predicted_citation_set": [
        "G5BLE-MQ75Y"
      ],
      "acceptable_refusal": false,
      "predicted_refusal": false,
      "answer_text": "The **Theatre of Magic**, a 1995 Bally pinball machine, is centered around magical illusions and features exciting gameplay with various modes and multiball objectives. Here\u0027s an overview of how to play and its main modes:\n\n### Key Features and Gameplay Objectives\n- **The Magic Trunk**: This is central to the game, enabling Illusion modes, jackpots, and multiball play.\n- **Illusions (Modes)**: There are 8 main modes to complete \u2014 called \u0022Illusions.\u0022 You start these by hitting the trunk to expose a hole, then shooting the hole. Examples include:\n  - **Tiger Saw**: Captive ball shots for points.\n  - **Safe Escape**: Loop shots to complete.\n  - **Levitating Woman**: Ramp shots to advance.\n  - **Spirit Cards**: Spinner rips for increasing value.\n  - Various others, each with unique shot goals.\n\nCompleting all 8 Illusions will light one of the Magicianship diamonds near the flippers.\n\n### Multiball and Wizard Mode\n- **Magic Multiball**: Lock balls via ramps and loops, then hit the trunk to start. Score Jackpots by repeatedly hitting the trunk.\n- **Tiger Saw Multiball**: Activated by locking a ball through the Vanish sequence.\n- **Grand Finale (Wizard Mode)**: Qualify by lighting all four Magicianship diamonds (earned through specific objectives \u2014 e.g., completing Illusions, advancing the clock, completing multiballs). The Grand Finale offers massive scoring opportunities on all major shots.\n\n### Tips for Play\n- **Build Bonus Multipliers**: Use top lanes to increase your multiplier, as the end-of-ball bonus can be significant.\n- **Start Illusions Early**: At the start of the game, you can nudge the flippers to pick which Illusion to start first \u2014 aim for those you\u2019re comfortable completing.\n- **Multiball Strategy**: During multiball, cradle one ball while using the other to shoot jackpots.\n- **Advancing the Clock**: Right orbit shots progress the clock and help light the Midnight Madness mode.\n\nFor comprehensive gameplay strategies and a detailed breakdown of scoring, you can check out Kineticist\u2019s Theatre of Magic tutorial or the OPDB entry for the game.\n\nLet me know if you\u0027d like details on a specific Illusion or mode!",
      "scores": {
        "citation_precision": 1,
        "citation_recall": 1,
        "citation_coverage": 0.14285714285714285,
        "subagent_accuracy": 1,
        "refusal_correctness": 1,
